gn: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">AI 분야의 지속 가능한 엔지니어로 성장할 싶은 분들의 많은 지원 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">*부스트캠프 AI Tech는 고용노동부 K-Digital Training 사업으로 운영하여 전액 무료로 참여할 수 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">■ 모집 기간 :&nbsp; 2023년 1월 9일(월) 오후 6시까지</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">■ 모집 분야 : 컴퓨터 비전(CV), 자연어 처리(NLP), 추천 시스템(RecSys)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">■ 지원하기 : https://bit.ly/boostcamp_aitech5_regi</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">■ 부스트캠프 공식 홈페이지 : boostcamp.connect.or.kr</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">■ 온라인 설명회 다시보기 : https://youtu.be/68wB7dt4ryQ</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
